Z||000010||stimpy||05-30-2001||11:17 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by tgowens:<BR><B>personally, I like gold........but then, there are not that many of them in gold (right Stimpy??)<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Gold is definately an eye-catching color on Fieros. Never fails to get compliments. It does have a nasty habit of fading off the car, but black is really much harder to keep in good condition. I say repaint gold!<P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
